00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:30,760
And you can find a Sankey diagram with the U.S. and every state at this web link at the

221
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:34,160
bottom, Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory.

222
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:38,880
What a Sankey diagram is, is basically a flow chart and it's a flow chart between the sources

223
00:16:38,880 --> 00:16:39,880
on the left.

224
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:44,200
You can see all of our energy sources, solar, nuclear, hydro, wind, geothermal, natural gas

